        <tr><th>Saved</th><td data-activate-word="saved">Saved: the unit stored the settings you changed. Change them later in its menu or on the update page.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Settings kept</th><td data-activate-word="skipped">Settings kept: the unit keeps its current aircraft type, callsign and own ICAO address. Change them later in its menu or on the update page.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>No Web Bluetooth</th><td data-activate-word="no_bluetooth">This browser has no Web Bluetooth. Use Chrome or Edge, on a computer or on Android. Safari, Firefox, and every browser on an iPhone or an iPad lack it.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Not a skyBlip</th><td data-activate-word="not_skyblip">The device you picked has no skyBlip settings service: it is not a skyBlip.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Link lost</th><td data-activate-word="link_lost">The link dropped. Bring the unit closer, connect again and activate again.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Anything else</th><td data-activate-word="failed">Something failed on the way:</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

